    "On the invoice page click Record Payment and enter the amount, date, method (bank transfer, cash or online) and optionally the receipt. The invoice becomes partially paid or paid by itself, and turns overdue when the due date passes unpaid.": "在发票页面点击“记录付款”，输入金额、日期、方式（银行转账、现金或在线支付），还可上传收据。发票会自动变为部分付款或已付款；若过了到期日仍未付款，则变为逾期。",
    "On the tenant’s page click Exit Tenant and enter the exit date, the exit amount (for example the deposit refunded), any extra charge and the reason. The unit becomes vacant at once and the tenant moves to the Exited tab; their history stays.": "在租户页面点击“办理退租”，输入退租日期、退租金额（例如退还的押金）、任何额外费用以及原因。该单位会立即变为空置，租户会移到“已退租”标签下，其历史记录仍会保留。",
    "Onboard tenants, renew leases and handle move-outs in a few clicks.": "轻点几下即可登记租户、续约和办理退租。",
    "One benefit per line.": "每行一项好处。",
    "One card per kind of user, with one point per line.": "每类用户一张卡片，每行一个要点。",
    "Only a pending agreement can be confirmed.": "只有待处理的合同才能确认。",
    "Only pending payments can be approved.": "只有待处理的付款才能批准。",
    "Only pending payments can be rejected.": "只有待处理的付款才能拒绝。",
    "Open Agreement to read your tenancy agreement. When it is pending, click Confirm Agreement to accept it.": "打开“合同”即可阅读您的租赁合同。合同待处理时，点击“确认合同”即可接受。",
    "Open Agreement → Create Agreement, choose the property and unit (the tenant is filled in), the dates and the status. The terms start from the default terms in Settings and can be changed per agreement. Set the status to Pending to let the tenant confirm it online from their own login.": "打开合同 → 创建合同，选择物业和单位（系统会自动填入租户）、日期和状态。条款以设置中的默认条款为基础，并可按合同修改。将状态设为“待处理”，租户即可通过自己的账户在线确认。",
    "Open Finance → Invoices and click Create Invoice.": "打开财务 → 发票，点击“创建发票”。",
    "Open Finance → Invoices and open the invoice.": "打开财务 → 发票，然后打开该发票。",
    "Open Jobs": "待处理工作",
    "Open Maintainers → Create Maintainer to add a tradesperson: their login, phone, trade (Electrician, Plumber…) and the properties they cover. Only maintainers who cover a property can be assigned its requests.": "打开维修人员 → 创建维修人员来添加技工：登录账户、电话、工种（电工、水管工……）以及负责的物业。只有负责某物业的维修人员才能被指派处理该物业的请求。",
    "Open Maintenance": "未完成维修",
    "Open Maintenance → Create, choose the issue type, describe the problem and attach a photo. Your property and unit are taken from your lease. Follow progress and add comments on the request page.": "打开维修 → 创建，选择问题类型，描述问题并附上照片。您的物业和单位会根据您的租约自动带出。可在请求页面跟进进度并添加备注。",
    "Open Real Estate → Properties and click Create Property.": "打开房地产 → 物业，点击“创建物业”。",
    "Open Staff Management → Roles and click Add Role.": "打开员工管理 → 角色，点击“添加角色”。",
    "Open Staff Management → Users, click Add User and give the user that role.": "打开员工管理 → 用户，点击“添加用户”并为该用户分配此角色。",
    "Open Tenants and click Create Tenant.": "打开租户，点击“创建租户”。",
    "Open the menu under your name (bottom of the sidebar) to update your name, email and password, add a passkey or turn on two-factor authentication.": "打开您姓名下方的菜单（侧边栏底部），即可更新姓名、电子邮件和密码，添加通行密钥或开启双重验证。",
    "Open the request, read the details and the tenant’s photo, then use Update Status to mark it In Progress or Completed. Add a comment to tell the office or the tenant what was done.": "打开请求，查看详情和租户上传的照片，然后使用“更新状态”将其标记为进行中或已完成。添加备注告知办公室或租户已完成的工作。",
    "Open the system in your browser and sign in with the email and password the management office gave you. There is no public sign-up: the admin creates every account. Use “Forgot password?” on the sign-in page to set a new password by email.": "在浏览器中打开系统，使用管理处提供的电子邮件和密码登录。系统不开放公开注册：所有账户均由管理员创建。可在登录页面使用“忘记密码？”通过电子邮件设置新密码。",
    "Opening a maintainer shows their contact details, trade, the properties they cover and every request assigned to them.": "打开维修人员可查看其联系方式、工种、负责的物业以及分配给他们的所有请求。",
    "Opening a request shows the property, unit, tenant, issue type, dates, notes, the attached photo (open it full size or download it), the assigned maintainer and the comment thread.": "打开请求可查看物业、单位、租户、问题类型、日期、备注、所附照片（可全尺寸查看或下载）、指派的维修人员以及备注记录。",
