    "Shows days left on the current lease, contact details, family size, address, the current property and unit, and the full lease history with every renewal and exit.": "显示当前租约的剩余天数、联系方式、家庭人数、地址、当前物业和单位，以及包含每次续约和退租的完整租约历史。",
    "Shows the invoice as it prints: your company details, the tenant billed, each line item, the total, the amount paid and still due, and the payment history with receipts.": "以打印样式显示发票：贵公司资料、开票租户、各项明细、合计、已付金额和未付金额，以及附有收据的付款记录。",
    "Shows your unit, rent, lease dates, the amount you owe, your unpaid invoices, your repair requests and the latest notices.": "显示您的单位、租金、租约日期、应付金额、未付发票、您的报修以及最新公告。",
