    "Staff Management": "员工管理",
    "Staff Management → Users adds staff logins (tenants and maintainers are added in their own modules). Roles lets you create roles such as “Accounts” and tick exactly which permissions they have. The Admin role cannot be edited, so nobody can lock the company out. Logged History shows every sign-in.": "员工管理 → 用户用于添加员工登录账户（租户和维修人员在各自的模块中添加）。角色可让您创建如“财务”之类的角色，并精确勾选其拥有的权限。管理员角色无法编辑，因此任何人都无法将公司锁在系统之外。登录记录会显示每一次登录。",
    "Staff and roles": "员工与角色",
    "Staff open Maintenance → All Requests → Create and choose the property, unit, issue type and date; the unit’s current tenant is filled in. Tenants log their own requests the same way, and only choose the issue type, notes and a photo.": "员工打开维修 → 所有请求 → 创建，选择物业、单位、问题类型和日期；系统会自动填入该单位的当前租户。租户也以同样方式提交自己的请求，只需选择问题类型、填写备注并上传照片。",
    "Staff see the number of properties, units and active tenants, the vacancy rate, this month’s revenue and expense, the amount still owed, open maintenance, an income and expense chart for the year, occupancy per property and the unpaid invoices due first.": "员工可看到物业、单位和在租租户的数量、空置率、本月收入和支出、尚未收回的金额、未完成的维修、全年收入与支出图表、各物业的入住率，以及最先到期的未付发票。",
    "Start": "开始",
    "Start a new lease period, in the same or another unit.": "在同一单位或其他单位开始新的租期。",
    "Status": "状态",
    "Status updated successfully.": "状态更新成功。",
    "Still owed on invoices": "发票仍欠款",
