    "System": "系统",
    "System Setup": "系统设置",
    "System Setup → Email Notification has one template per event: tenant or maintainer created, maintenance request created or completed, invoice created, payment reminder and payment received. Edit the subject and message in each language, use the listed placeholders such as {tenant_name} or {amount}, and switch any email off.": "系统设置 → 电子邮件通知为每个事件提供一个模板：租户或维修人员已创建、维修请求已创建或已完成、发票已创建、付款提醒和已收到付款。可编辑每种语言的主题和内容，使用列出的占位符（如 {tenant_name} 或 {amount}），并可关闭任何邮件。",
    "System Setup → Frontend Manager → Home Page edits the hero text, the cards for tenants, maintainers and management, the features, the benefits and the questions and answers. Text is shown exactly as typed.": "系统设置 → 前台网站管理 → 首页用于编辑首屏横幅文字、租户、维修人员和管理层卡片、功能、优势以及问答。文字会按输入内容原样显示。",
    "System Setup → Settings holds your company name, address and tax details (printed on invoices and agreements), the number prefixes for invoices, expenses and agreements, the date, time and currency formats, the email (SMTP) server and the default agreement terms. Use “Send Test Email” after saving the email settings.": "系统设置 → 设置用于保存贵公司的名称、地址和税务资料（打印在发票和合同上），发票、支出和合同的编号前缀，日期、时间和货币格式，电子邮件 (SMTP) 服务器以及默认合同条款。保存电子邮件设置后，请使用“发送测试邮件”。",
    "System Setup → Types lists the choices used in forms: invoice item types (Rent, Utility, Late Fee…), expense types, maintenance issue types and maintainer trades. Add your own and switch off any you don’t use.": "系统设置 → 类型列出表单中使用的选项：发票项目类型（租金、水电费、滞纳金……）、支出类型、维修问题类型和维修人员工种。您可以添加自己的选项，并关闭不使用的选项。",
    "Tenancy agreements and the dates that matter.": "租赁合同及重要日期。",
