    "Tenants log issues, you assign maintainers and follow progress to completion.": "租户提交问题，您指派维修人员并跟进直至完成。",
    "Tenants pay by bank transfer and upload the receipt on their invoice. The payment stays pending until staff click Approve (or Reject) on the invoice page; only approved payments count, and the tenant is emailed a receipt.": "租户通过银行转账付款，并在发票上上传收据。在员工于发票页面点击“批准”（或“拒绝”）之前，付款会保持待处理状态；只有已批准的付款才会计入，租户会通过邮件收到收据。",
    "Tenants pay rent, view agreements and report repairs. Our team handles properties, tenancies and maintenance.": "租户可缴纳租金、查看合同和报修。物业、租赁和维修由我们的团队负责。",
