    "The sidebar groups every module the same way as the menu: Overview, Property Management, Communication and System Setup. Groups with an arrow open to show their pages, and “Search menu…” at the top finds any page by name. Your dashboard is the first page after signing in.": "侧边栏按与菜单相同的方式对所有模块分组：概览、物业管理、沟通和系统设置。带箭头的分组可展开显示其页面，顶部的“搜索菜单...”可按名称查找任意页面。登录后的第一个页面是您的仪表板。",
