    "Use \"Forgot password\" on the login page and we will email you a reset link.": "在登录页面点击“忘记密码”，我们会通过电子邮件发送重置链接。",
    "Use Assign on a request to pick the maintainer and set the status: Pending, In Progress or Completed. The Pending and In Progress menus list what is still open. Everyone involved can add comments on the request page, and the tenant is emailed when it is completed.": "在请求上使用“指派”选择维修人员并设置状态：待处理、进行中或已完成。“待处理”和“进行中”菜单列出仍未完成的请求。所有相关人员都可以在请求页面添加备注，请求完成后租户会收到邮件通知。",
    "Use Print on an invoice or agreement page; only the document itself is printed, with your company details from Settings.": "在发票或合同页面使用“打印”；只会打印文档本身，并附上设置中的公司资料。",
    "Use the language button at the top right of every page to switch between English, Bahasa Melayu and 中文; your choice is remembered and emails are sent to you in it. The moon/sun button next to it switches between dark and light mode.": "使用每个页面右上角的语言按钮可在 English、Bahasa Melayu 和中文之间切换；系统会记住您的选择，并以该语言向您发送邮件。旁边的月亮/太阳按钮可在深色和浅色模式之间切换。",
